{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12204450","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12204450","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1220445001:0":{"text":"You... bah, you brat, we still have your sister! If you don't want to play nice, then...","source_cn":"你们……呸，臭小子，你妹妹还在我们手里！既然你不想乖乖...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86342B40568E868E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1220445002:0":{"text":"Oh, right. A couple of days ago, while we were tidying up the port and maintaining order, we caught a few kidnappers.","source_cn":"啊，对了，前两天我们清理港口环境、维护城市秩序的时候，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x602F60B24ADDEE07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1220445003:0":{"text":"That's right, boss. We rescued that girl ages ago, and as for those kidnappers, hehe...","source_cn":"是的，二当家。那个被绑架的小姑娘早就救出来了，那些绑架...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB834E9B9FBDEC086","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1220445004:0":{"text":"Nothing more than fish food!","source_cn":"都扔进海里喂鲨鱼啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2CCBC3425DF3CEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1220445005:0":{"text":"...You... you!","source_cn":"……你们……你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04B83BB547C944C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1220445006:0":{"text":"Here's the deal, the Carmine Whispers will compensate you. See it as us acquiring this fighter, and in return, you will never bother him again.","source_cn":"听好了，血薇帮会付给你一笔钱，就当我们买走这个拳手，你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC24B1E100CF0A824","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1220445007:0":{"text":"This matter is settled. My decision. Who agrees, and who objects?","source_cn":"这件事就此结束。我的决定，谁赞成，谁反对？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x600F29E75D2D041C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1220445008:0":{"text":"Chippy and Hammie both agree! The Magister does too!","source_cn":"漫漫和满满都赞成！主人也赞成！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6F0FB9C01C53D876","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Chippy and Hammie both agree! The Magister does too!","female":"Chippy and Hammie both agree! The Magister does too!","variant_male_record_index":"132803","variant_female_record_index":"132804","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1220445009:0":{"text":"I...","source_cn":"我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6738659A646BE45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1220445010:0":{"text":"You object? In that case, we can replace the boss of the underground boxing ring. Sonja likely won't mind.","source_cn":"你有意见？那么，给地下黑拳市场换个庄家，索尼娅当家应该...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96180518E7AD1158","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1220445011:0":{"text":"What? No, absolutely not... alright, alright... I agree...","source_cn":"什么？不行，绝对不行……好、好吧……我同意……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x588DC33C563CC4BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1220445012:0":{"text":"That's better, now remember what you said. We in Rustport also follow rules.","source_cn":"这就对了，记得你说的话。咱们锈锚港的人，也是要讲规矩的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BEF10639E5371C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1220445013:0":{"text":"You... you!","source_cn":"你……你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0F8E90CBB64EDE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1220445014:0":{"text":"Eh, why did he collapse? Did he faint? Wow, Lucca, you're amazing!","source_cn":"咦，他怎么倒了，是晕过去了吗？哇，卢卡，你也太厉害了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9373AFD8F2D271D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":""